      "content": [
       {
        "content": [
         {
          "text": "Since the code was moved out to the fc-authn project the duplicate code still in trunk has been updated. These updates need to be resolved and the code in trunk needs to be removed, with the fc-authn jar being brought in as a dependency.",
          "type": "text"
         }
        ],
        "type": "paragraph"
       },
       {
        "content": [
         {
          "text": "This task should likely be completed along with FCREPO-122.",
          "type": "text"
         }
        ],
        "type": "paragraph"
